#!/usr/bin/env perl

# Draws the example picture examples/images/mandelbrot.png: a 480x320
# detail of the Mandelbrot set in the seahorse valley, its spirals in
# smooth bands of a cyclic palette, the set itself in deep navy. Every
# pixel averages SUBSAMPLES x SUBSAMPLES points in linear light, and the
# band of a point is its escape time made continuous, so neighboring
# pixels differ only a little: a picture with fine detail and smooth
# gradients that half blocks cannot show. Needs Imager with PNG support;
# takes some seconds.
#
#     perl tools/mandelbrot                    # writes examples/images/mandelbrot.png
#     perl tools/mandelbrot --output FILE.png
#
# See tools/README.md.
#
